  "problem": "A tutoring agency assigns a tutor to either High School $A$ or High School $B.$ With probability $0.45,$ the tutor is sent to High School $A,$ where the expected number of students tutored in a day is $4.8.$ With probability $0.55,$ the tutor is sent to High School $B,$ where the expected number of students tutored is $6.2.$\n\nWhat is the expected number of students tutored in a day?",
